On 2026-10-18, Nanaloveyuki confirmed that the original author's permission
had been obtained to vendor, decompile and take over RatkinRecycle under
MIT OR Apache-2.0. The supplied chat screenshot identifies the original
author and contains the reply “放心做”. The licensing basis recorded here
is the maintainer's express confirmation; the screenshot itself does not
spell out either license. This does not assert a transfer of copyright.

Imported from the locally installed “鼠族回收行为 RatkinRecycle”, originally
package dsh.ratkinrecycle, declaring RimWorld 1.6 support. The installation
contained no source or license file. An untouched distribution archive and
SHA-256 manifest are retained in docs/references/.

Changes by Nanaloveyuki, 2026-10-18:
- Recovered C# source with ILSpy and added a reproducible 1.6 build project.
- Changed About package ID and Harmony ID to nanaloveyuki.ratkinrecycle.
- Retained the original author and added maintainer attribution and dependency links.
- Rebuilt the maintainer 1.6 DLL, now frozen under 1.6/Assemblies;
  original author DLL remains in the archive.
- Added dual-license texts, documentation and a typographic About/Preview.png
  using the original stop-bleeding station icon.
- Added isolated 1.7 .NET 10 / Harmony 3 output and explicit LoadFolders routing.
- Preserved the 1.6 release bytes and copied unchanged XML/textures to Common.
- Corrected the Solaris.RatkinRaceMod Workshop link to verified ID 1578693166.

Original Def names, gameplay XML, texture, assembly name and namespace are
retained. The 1.7 port does not include unrelated gameplay or persistence fixes.
